Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This story is best told\Nfrom the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 1965, and a storm\Nraged both outside and within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoner 696, what's going on back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the problem, 696?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't end up agreeing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Girlie's pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a remote women's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our security is top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No guy could get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, when did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's here for eight years\Nfor robbery and assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's two wins, so this\Ndoesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you know when this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't so much as\Na bump this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to talk, Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the kid's daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't knock up yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The father is dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Over two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some I want to\Nshare with you too, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the barnacles grown in my knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.10,0:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the kid made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he's a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This little rugrat was born\Nwith his eyes wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But the really bizarre thing\Nis, he hasn't cried at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't have to tell you,\Nthis is no place for a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have to be adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where are you from, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, the child was taken in\Nby a village priest on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Time seemed to fly by,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and over the years, the young boy gained\Na reputation for his bashful naivete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Froggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the road, Katsune!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't blabber to Padre!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, they were mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I'm glad you're\Nokay, my little amiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You like frogs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't stand bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too fond of\Nfunky-smelling guys either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate anything that isn't beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You from around here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, would you like\Nsomething cold to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So how does sparkling water sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, French mineral water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your treat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to become a sailor? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially for a simple\Nsoul like yours. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you'll make a wonderful mariner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that he walked all\Nthe way here is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good on the lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time he had a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanting to build a carport\Nnext to the boy's room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the priest began digging up the\Nfloor tiles and underlying concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He carefully chiseled away at the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,until he uncovered her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the woman who gave birth\Nto his adopted son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She was paralyzed and unable to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But something was keeping her\Ntethered to the world of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She lay buried for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Her mind vacant with\Nno conception of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether by hatred or love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart had been obfuscated by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The hair is the same color as.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That night, a horrific\Nfire ravaged the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,strengthened by the night's howling winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While no cause could be found, Seven died,\Nwhile countless others remained missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Among those listed on the\Ncoroner's report were the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,village priest and the adopted\Nson he loved so dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up. I'm not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a truck bearing down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go take your Sunday stroll somewhere\Nelse, you freakin' Straizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem to be your day, huh, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or am I sensing more of a\Nrough patch in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one hell of a psychic, because\NI've got nothing but problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be interested\Nin hearing your fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes at a special rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,huh thanks but no sardinia\Nis the locale of your birth
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't that correct not only\Nthe hat but you haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,been back to the old stomping\Ngrounds in quite some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,time that's not exactly\Nfortune-telling of course
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you can tell I'm visiting\Nfrom out of town my outfit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,is a total giveaway dear\Nragazzo you harbor a great
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,secret within you a shadow\Nin the Sun two sides of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A coin you child, lead two entirely\Ndissimilar lives. Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you take advantage of\Nyour harrowing secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,which combined with your\Ntenacious personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,has earned you a great many victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, scusi, I spoke out of turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand, your face is very\Nbeguiling to a fortune teller like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me the honor of\Ntelling your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty, no, ten thousand lira will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who among us doesn't have\None secret or another?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this stuff could apply to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're searching for somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This person is very important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't all of us just looking for\Nsomeone who's important to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're desperate for the perfect\Npartner or faultless friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's kind of fun\Nhaving someone guess your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do that anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,With that crystal ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.52,0:08:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already begun by other means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, the mud on your\Ntrousers tells me a great deal. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Romani have practiced\Nthis divination for millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The spontaneity of nature holds powers\Ngreater than our wildest imaginations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That splatter is a symbol of\Nmankind's fate. Your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the person who you've come all\Nthis way to find is your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've returned to Sardinia\Nto find the child you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,fathered with the woman you\Nleft behind 15 years ago huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How very strange your youthfulness\NI know I just uttered those
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,words but I'm completely baffled\Nyou think I'm a father yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Really I'm quite certain of it I must\Nread your palm hey I beg of you my worth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,as a fortune teller hinges on this I\Ndon't want your money in fact I'll pay 20,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,100,000 Lira!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bleeding here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me the hell alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you could predict the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That ability will be useless\Nto you once you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you're not a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity you've had to peddle\Nyour talents of perception
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,on the side of the road\Nlike a common beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the greatest misstep of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Divine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone who possesses any knowledge of my\Ntrue self must not be allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have proven yourself to be a\Nfortune teller of the highest caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've my admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so I shall kill you in a way that\Ninflicts the least amount of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But my generosity comes with a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The traitor in this picture\Nis known as Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He desires to reveal my true identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and has made it his mission\Nto seek out my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your divination to\Nreveal this man's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want his location?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'm sure you'll\Nencounter him soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He has come to Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His heart burns with revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question your paths will cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I was right about your nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly like two sides of a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dual personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you bear this secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the death of others\Nwill be your fortune and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,eternal glory will spring\Nforth from your fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your glorious palm\Nglows with stunning beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen a hand so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything looks different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't how the lifeline was at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my own severed hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.62,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you weren't flattened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no place for a guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on now, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to, signore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Costa Smeralda, please. Cierto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next story comes to us from Sardinia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,where the investigation of an airplane\Ncrash near the city of Olvia continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite a strong effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:13:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Scusi, would you happen to\Nhave a phone I could use?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's totally broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver, stop the taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get out, and here\Nis as good a spot as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is keep\Nan eye on that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Costa Smeralda of Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just over a half a century ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,before the beauty of its waters and shore\Ncaught the eyes of an Indian magnet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the secluded locale was practically\Nunknown to the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think your meter may be off by a digit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're accusing me of ripping\Nyou off by rigging the meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but 800,000 lira to go from\Ntown to here seems a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like someone coming\Nhere doesn't have cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I didn't see you hiding\Nsomething when you were back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I saw you stashing\Nan envelope in your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You see? Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have kept\Nthose peepers to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your damn curiosity's\Nabout to get you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do-do-do. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that just now? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer the damn question!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way that busted up phone\Nwas ringing, so what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I, I don't know, what you're even taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do—do—do—do—do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? There it is again. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do-do-do-do-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do-do-do-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So you do have a working phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been holding out on me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, yes, I just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Same spot as the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So all I've got to do is\Nkeep an eye out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So because he didn't get a good look at\Nwhat was inside, he's allowed to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to question your\Ninfinite wisdom, boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty positive the driver\Nsaw something he shouldn't have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my apologies, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already begun keeping\Nwatch over the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're watching the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd re-evaluate, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look harder, but move slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no sudden movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not appear flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who's being watched\Nright now is you, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Risotto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the traitors\Nfrom the Hitman team!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ian Dolphin was right! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's certainly a crafty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The plane crash managed to tip him off to\Nthe photo of Sardinia from Trisha's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first order of business\Nis to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he'll be even more\Ntrouble once Trisha arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the killing blow to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to close the distance between\Nus without revealing your true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I have no insight\Ninto Risotto's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lure him within two meters of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the fool well within\NEmperor Crimson's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao, Doppio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Atta, mi caro. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's the least of my worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss just called with a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep an eye on the\Nbuilding, and then I need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say? Close the gap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Move in closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but closer to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen, so don't stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen that face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your hand away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this always have to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This coward doesn't have the\Nfaintest clue what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No one from Passione\Nwould behave like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he's practically\Nbegging to be attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's just your\Nrun-of-the-mill brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just grabbing my knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're of no interest to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is aching.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I'm remembering, you did\Ndo something kind of fishy back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When you tripped and fell on your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you almost reflexively hid\Nthe envelope on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I saw you hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Under your foot. So what's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's nothing, I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I told you I'm broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense no bloodlust or hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I know a liar when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up and show me what\Nyou're hiding underfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I set up, dammit! Hop to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It is just an envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing's totally empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess the groveling\Nwasn't an act after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a coward who\Ncan't lie to save his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, everything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You intrigue me more\Nand more every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt you're a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You also heard that sound, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, you made a stealthy\Nglance towards that whirring noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's combing the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're carrying out a\Nreconnaissance mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That could only be one stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They finally made it to Sardinia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, you'd have to be very\Nspecial to be sent to this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly the boss has a\Ntremendous deal of faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that, your\Nfear's 100 % genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You are quite the\Nfascinating contradiction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who's going to be\Nquaking with fear is you, Stronezo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your charging ahead tells me you're\Na close-range user with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your range is two or three\Nmeters, as long as I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you's easy. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These actual razor blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to get within two\Nmeters of this edgy douche!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I do, I'll jam these\Nblades straight up his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I know just how to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that hurt, but you're still dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But how am I supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I heard a phone ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would ever guess there'd be\Na payphone all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the time is not yet right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you close the gap between\Nthe two of you, I cannot act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If he catches sight of me\Nand manages to get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,all our efforts will have been for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Move within two meters of risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.38,0:21:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I still have no\Nidea how his powers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just gonna get me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet, charming Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you so easily\Nforgotten that I bestowed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you with part of Emperor Crimson's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to\Napply your unique talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is just fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They are a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They dare to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bad and what's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is we are. The fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for. The rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
